OL,3,GNEWSAScunthorpe Utd would 'embrace'
OL,4,ATinie Tempah visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-owner of Scunthorpe United FC
OL,7,Fsays the club would "love to embrace"
OL,8,Frapper Tinie Tempah if he were to visit
OL,9,Fthe town.
OL,11,FHis 2010 number 1 hit Pass Out included
OL,12,Fthe lyrics "I been Southampton, but
OL,13,FI've never been to Scunthorpe", and
OL,14,Fefforts are being made to put that
OL,15,Fright.
OL,17,FAn online campaign to get him to
OL,18,Fperform in North Lincolnshire was
OL,19,Fstarted recently by local fan Ben
OL,20,FJohns.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
