OL,3,GNEWSAScunthorpe Utd would 'embrace'
OL,4,ATinie Tempah visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Newsnight earlier this
OL,7,Fmonth, the rapper said he thought "this
OL,8,Fis the time" to visit the town.
